                      (adybug/src/main.s):00001         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract reset_bonus_colour profile=state: Initialize the existing collectible cycle red with thirty scheduled ticks and invalidate the existing entity colour cache at initial and next-stage boundaries.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00002         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract presentation_key_service profile=input: Call the bounded physical key component while preserving the caller bank mapping.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00003         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract asset_draw_hud_digit profile=render: Draw one shared-font HUD digit.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00004         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract asset_draw_two_digits profile=render: Draw a two-digit HUD value with a leading zero.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00005         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract life_marker_position profile=render: Map reserve slots 0-11 to authored HUD tile roots; write HUD_X and HUD_Y only.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00006         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract adaptive_install_active profile=copy: Restore the active low-RAM driver from staged page $3D after a presentation overlay retires.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00007         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract AD_WORK_EXEC profile=framebuffer: Execute the active logical batch, damage reduction, audio service and BACK publication transaction.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00008         ; DOC-002 source-contract mirror contract AD_RESET_EXEC profile=state: Rebase adaptive phase time and clear both damage journals outside active publication.
